OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt The Farmer's Boy Inn in
OL,7,     FGloucestershire, pie entrepreneur
OL,8,     FPhil sets his guests a pie-making
OL,9,     Fchallenge. In the morning, the
OL,10,     Fgroup work up an appetite for
OL,11,     Fbreakfast on the bouncy castle.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FAlan and Jane welcome their
OL,14,     Ffirst-ever guests aboard their
OL,15,     Fbrand-new, purpose-built hotel
OL,16,     Fboat, the Geanna, and pull out all
OL,17,     Fthe stops with a champagne cruise
OL,18,     Falong the Thames.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/12
