OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThere are high hopes for Sarah and
OL,7,     FJean-Pierre's B&B, Sentry Mead.
OL,8,     FThe hosts serve a five-star dinner
OL,9,     Fand breakfast, but Jane feels
OL,10,     Fmugged off and Phil's not keen on
OL,11,     Fthe towels.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet for one last time to settle
OL,15,     Fsome scores and find out how much
OL,16,     Fthey've been paid. But some of the
OL,17,     Fhosts' emotions run away with
OL,18,     Fthem.
